'''Perfect Ba-Ba''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat [[Ba-Ba]] in a group of two or more, at raid level 150 or above, without anyone taking any damage from the following: Ba-Ba's Attacks off-prayer, Ba-Ba's slam, rolling boulders, rubble attack or falling rocks. No sarcophagi may be opened. The player must have all Ba-Ba invocations activated.

* This Combat achievement '''CAN''' be re-attempted by wiping.
* This combat achievement is not failed if a player is struck by bananas.

